&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior IT Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to join the &lt;strong&gt;Mobile Device Management (MDM) Tribe at HelloFresh&lt;/strong&gt;. As a senior individual contributor, you will play a key role in designing, optimizing, and evolving our endpoint management environment across &lt;strong&gt;macOS, Windows, and mobile platforms&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will bring deep expertise in &lt;strong&gt;Microsoft Intune, Jamf Pro&lt;/strong&gt; combined with a strong understanding of endpoint security, identity, automation, and modern device management practices. You will help shape our MDM strategy, drive technical improvements, and ensure a secure, scalable, and exceptional user experience.This is an &lt;strong&gt;Individual Contributor (IC)&lt;/strong&gt; role with a strong focus on technical ownership, architecture, automation, continuous improvement, and knowledge sharing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;make HelloFresh&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;better.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design&lt;/strong&gt;, implement, and continuously improve scalable MDM solutions across macOS, Windows, iOS, and Android, balancing security, compliance, and user experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define&lt;/strong&gt; and maintain MDM standards, policies, configuration profiles, application management, and compliance controls aligned with HelloFresh security and business requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leverage&lt;/strong&gt; PowerShell, Bash, and Microsoft Graph API to automate device management, compliance, reporting, remediation, and enforcement workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build&lt;/strong&gt; meaningful reporting and analytics to monitor device health, compliance, application status, security posture, and fleet trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proactively&lt;/strong&gt; identify risks, dependencies, and opportunities for improvement, and drive structured solutions from problem definition through implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentor&lt;/strong&gt; and coach team members, promote knowledge sharing, and contribute to cross-training and continuous improvement across the MDM Tribe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Strong enterprise MDM experience with deep hands-on and architectural expertise in Microsoft Intune and Jamf Pro/Jamf Connect across macOS, Windows, iOS, and Android.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Good understanding of endpoint architecture and the broader technology ecosystem, including Microsoft Entra ID, Apple Business Manager, Windows Autopilot, Conditional Access, EDR, Zscaler, and privilege management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Experience with PowerShell and Bash scripting and the ability to automate endpoint management, remediation, and operational processes using Microsoft Graph API.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Solid understanding of endpoint security principles, including encryption, compliance, device security, identity-driven access, and security controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Excellent communication and stakeholder-management skills, with the ability to explain complex technical topics to audiences ranging from engineers to Directors and Senior Directors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;A collaborative and egoless mindset with a willingness to share knowledge, mentor colleagues, and contribute to the technical growth of the wider team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elevate your lifestyle! Join one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing tech powerhouses in a dynamic phase of expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in a diverse global community of 90+ nationalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a competitive compensation package that goes beyond the norm, with perks like a HelloFresh- subsidized Pension Scheme, Berlin relocation support, and a Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate your lifestyle with exclusive discounts on your weekly HelloFresh box and office meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in your growth with a German language learning budget, and access to the HelloFresh Academy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus, we&#39;ve got your well-being covered with mental health support, transportation perks, and working-parent-friendly benefits. From our 24/7 gym access,wellbeing platforms like Headspace and Spill, to sabbatical leave options, HelloFresh is not just a workplace; it&#39;s a lifestyle of perks and possibilities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#IT&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced Director, People Technology to lead the People Technology function at HelloFresh. This role is accountable for the strategy, operating model, delivery, stability and performance of our global People Technology landscape.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own the end-to-end technology environment that enables the People function and supports critical operational execution across the business, with Workday as the core platform. This includes functional development, operations, integrations, programme delivery, AI enablement, and business-critical workforce technology such as Time Tracking, Absence and time clocking devices across our distribution centres.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role has a clear AI mandate. You will define how People Technology uses AI to improve its own productivity, service quality, delivery speed and decision-making, while also partnering with People leaders to identify, govern and deploy AI-enabled solutions for our People function customers. This includes moving beyond experimentation into responsible, scalable and measurable adoption.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will partner closely with People, Technology and Operations leaders to translate business needs into a clear, executable technology roadmap. The role requires strong judgement, clear prioritisation and the ability to balance transformation, platform health, operational reliability, business continuity and user experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the People Technology strategy and roadmap, aligned to People, Technology and Operations priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the evolution of the People Technology operating model across Operations, Functional Development, Integrations and Programme Management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure Workday and related People Technology platforms are stable, scalable, secure and fit for purpose.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the technology performance of business-critical workforce processes, including Time Tracking, Absence and time clocking across distribution centres.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Operations stakeholders to ensure workforce technology supports reliable execution in frontline and operational environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and drive the People Technology AI strategy, including internal productivity, automation, service improvement and delivery effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with People leaders to identify, prioritise and deliver responsible AI-enabled solutions for People function customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish appropriate governance for AI use across People Technology, including risk, data protection, adoption, measurement and change management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set priorities for major initiatives, balancing delivery ambition, operational risk, capacity and long-term platform health.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the senior escalation point for complex delivery, operational, vendor or system-risk issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Technology leadership on architecture, security, integrations, data and platform sustainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent People Technology in senior leadership forums and cross-functional decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience in People Technology, HR systems or enterprise SaaS leadership roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Workday-centric technology landscapes, including implementation, optimisation and operational support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience leading multi-disciplinary technology teams across operations, delivery, integrations and specialist domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting technology used in frontline, operational or distribution-centre environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience identifying and deploying AI or automation opportunities in an enterprise function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of responsible AI adoption, including governance, data, risk, change management and measurable business value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong judgement in balancing transformation, system stability, governance, operational risk and business continuity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating in global, complex organisations with senior cross-functional stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to translate People, Technology and Operations priorities into clear, executable plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable making and owning difficult prioritisation and trade-off decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English; additional languages are a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a discount on HelloFresh meal kits, delivered straight to your door.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build for the long-term with our company pension scheme (not available for interns/working students).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Benefit from discounted memberships with Urban Sports Club and John Reed, yoga classes, and access to Headspace and Spill.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance your work and life with flexible hours, Work From Home/Abroad options, and a home office setup budget.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Receive childcare support (not available for interns/working students).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get a monthly allowance for the Deutschlandticket to support sustainable commuting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embrace &quot;Learning Never Stops&quot; with access to internal trainings and a central L&amp;amp;D budget (remove for interns).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from a modern, comfortable office in Berlin-Kreuzberg and enjoy social events like team outings, Friday beers, and company runs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Location&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;: We are flexible! Come and join us either in Hamburg, Berlin or Barcelona.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Freenow empowers smarter mobility decisions helping people to move freely and cities to thrive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Product Data Analyst (m/f/d) &lt;/strong&gt;to collaborate with our product squads, using data to build a flawless product experience. You will join the Product Data Team and work closely with PMs, designers, UX researchers, developers, and other data functions to discover new product opportunities, validate hypotheses, and launch valuable features to our users.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be ready to work in a multinational, diverse, highly motivated and collaborative team of passionate analysts who strive for excellence and like to have fun.&amp;nbsp; Are you ready for your next ride?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR DAILY ADVENTURES WILL INCLUDE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Providing&amp;nbsp; expertise and collaborating with stakeholders to generate new product feature ideas and improvements, and also estimating the potential impact of planned projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously engaging with the product squads to gain an understanding of the problems that need to be solved, gathering requirements, and defining the best deliverables to match the business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Having full ownership of your analysis, from ideation to communication of results and making recommendations to all levels of the company including senior management and prioritization committees.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing and evaluating A/B test experiments or other analyses to measure and report the performance of released features, ensuring that we are launching the correct changes and features in our apps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working closely with our developers and data engineers to create and capture data that is aligned with the business logic and allows modeling and analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being involved throughout the complete product lifecycle in order to guarantee a data-driven process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bringing new insights and championing them using your analyses, dashboards, and good storytelling! We value ideas over hierarchy, and there&#39;s always a new path to follow if your idea is convincing and well-backed with data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will have the opportunity to steer our products, which kind of features should be developed, and which changes should be made to solve hundreds of thousands of users&#39; daily needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TO BE SUCCESSFUL IN THIS ROLE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You &lt;strong&gt;have curiosity in your essence&lt;/strong&gt;, which motivates you to&lt;strong&gt; answer WHY things happened&lt;/strong&gt;, not only scratching the surface, but aiming for well-founded actionable results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in Mathematics, Statistics, Economics, Computer Science, Engineering, or other fields with a strong mathematical-statistical background&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3+ years experience in working as a Data Analyst in a data-driven analytics environment&lt;/strong&gt;, preferably within tech product organizations, having direct contact with stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exceptional analytical skills&lt;/strong&gt;, lateral thinking, and proven experience in solving highly challenging problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Very good knowledge of SQL,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;databases, and statistical programming tools (e.g. Python, R) so that exploratory analyses can be performed, reports created and ETLs maintained&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding and hands-on experience in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;analyzing and interpreting A/B test results&lt;/strong&gt;, backed by statistical knowledge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience in working with data visualisation tools&lt;/strong&gt; (e.g.Tableau, Qlikview) and event tracking (e.g. Mixpanel, GA, Firebase)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are able to communicate findings in a concise and clear manner&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;to a wide variety of stakeholders to support data-driven decision making by using data visualisation and storytelling and have excellent English communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
