&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot; data-start=&quot;802&quot; data-end=&quot;958&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;This is a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;812&quot; data-end=&quot;847&quot;&gt;hybrid role based in Manchester&lt;/strong&gt;. While our permanent office is being finalised, you&#39;ll initially work from a temporary workspace and remotely.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot; data-start=&quot;960&quot; data-end=&quot;1013&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;All applicants must have the right to work in the UK.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;v5cssg&quot; data-start=&quot;1020&quot; data-end=&quot;1032&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Your Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot; data-start=&quot;1034&quot; data-end=&quot;1221&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;As a Senior Talent Acquisition Associate, you&#39;ll manage full-cycle recruitment across graduate, corporate and business hiring while supporting the continued growth of Guidepoint&#39;s UK operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot; data-start=&quot;1223&quot; data-end=&quot;1536&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll partner with hiring managers to deliver recruitment strategies, build strong talent pipelines and provide an exceptional candidate experience. Alongside business-as-usual recruitment, you&#39;ll play a key role in developing our UK campus recruitment programme and representing Guidepoint at university events.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;11vcmyo&quot; data-start=&quot;1543&quot; data-end=&quot;1560&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1562&quot; data-end=&quot;2152&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;avpotq&quot; data-start=&quot;1562&quot; data-end=&quot;1641&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Manage full-cycle recruitment across graduate, corporate and business hiring.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;83uj6z&quot; data-start=&quot;1642&quot; data-end=&quot;1717&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Partner with hiring managers to deliver effective recruitment strategies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;se7u3s&quot; data-start=&quot;1718&quot; data-end=&quot;1783&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Source and engage high-quality talent across multiple channels.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1p4jssp&quot; data-start=&quot;1784&quot; data-end=&quot;1868&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Build relationships with UK universities, careers teams and student organisations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1sb5ibo&quot; data-start=&quot;1869&quot; data-end=&quot;1961&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Represent Guidepoint at careers fairs, networking events and employer branding activities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1bpvpz9&quot; data-start=&quot;1962&quot; data-end=&quot;2040&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Manage candidate communications, interview coordination and offer processes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;j87l8b&quot; data-start=&quot;2041&quot; data-end=&quot;2152&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Collaborate with the Global Talent Acquisition team to improve recruitment processes and share best practice.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;cubbob&quot; data-start=&quot;2159&quot; data-end=&quot;2179&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2181&quot; data-end=&quot;2721&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1u6300l&quot; data-start=&quot;2181&quot; data-end=&quot;2226&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree or equivalent experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;iombk6&quot; data-start=&quot;2227&quot; data-end=&quot;2298&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;2–4 years&#39; experience in full-cycle recruitment (agency or in-house).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;26dnj&quot; data-start=&quot;2299&quot; data-end=&quot;2356&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong stakeholder management and communication skills.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;10h0h6g&quot; data-start=&quot;2357&quot; data-end=&quot;2438&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Excellent organisational skills with the ability to manage multiple priorities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1iul394&quot; data-start=&quot;2439&quot; data-end=&quot;2510&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience sourcing and engaging candidates across multiple channels (LinkedIn Recruiter e.g.)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;11xbd0n&quot; data-start=&quot;2511&quot; data-end=&quot;2578&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Proficiency with Applicant Tracking Systems and Microsoft Office.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;2dtbmh&quot; data-start=&quot;2579&quot; data-end=&quot;2721&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Ability to use AI-enabled tools thoughtfully and responsibly, with attention to accuracy, confidentiality, data quality and human judgement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;12lll1&quot; data-start=&quot;2728&quot; data-end=&quot;2744&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;What We Offer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and bonus.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Excellent medical coverage through BUPA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Professional development opportunities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Supportive culture that celebrates and rewards success&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Informal work environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Employee Assistance Programs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Volunteer days&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1ypf1c2&quot; data-start=&quot;2778&quot; data-end=&quot;2799&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Hybrid working.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1hr9wvq&quot; data-start=&quot;2818&quot; data-end=&quot;2878&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Opportunity to help launch Guidepoint&#39;s Manchester office and shape our UK campus recruitment programme&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;if6smq&quot; data-start=&quot;2949&quot; data-end=&quot;3014&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;International exposure within a global Talent Acquisition team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1662r9m&quot; data-start=&quot;3015&quot; data-end=&quot;3084&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Collaborative team environment and regular social events.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Guidepoint:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Guidepoint powers end-to-end research workflows for the world’s best research teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Backed by a global network of more than&lt;strong&gt; 2 million experts and over 1,600 employees,&lt;/strong&gt; Guidepoint delivers real-time access to expertise, primary research, and actionable knowledge that help organizations make informed decisions. Through consultations, surveys, events, proprietary content, and AI-enabled tools, we support every stage of the decision-making process—from developing hypotheses and gathering insights to validating assumptions and building conviction for critical decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;At Guidepoint, our success relies on the diversity of our employees, experts, and clients, which enables us to foster meaningful connections and a broad range of perspectives. We are committed to creating an inclusive and welcoming environment where individuals of all backgrounds, identities, and experiences can contribute and succeed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;#LI-DT1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;The CRM Account Director is responsible for building and growing strategic client relationships while ensuring clients realise measurable value from their CRM investment. Acting as a trusted advisor, they work closely with senior client stakeholders to shape CRM strategy, drive adoption, identify growth opportunities and ensure successful delivery across marketing, technology and data initiatives.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The role combines commercial account leadership with strategic CRM consulting, partnering with internal cross-functional teams to deliver outstanding client outcomes and long-term customer success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Client Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted relationships with senior client stakeholders, including CRM Directors, Marketing Directors, Digital Directors and C-suite executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a deep understanding of each client&#39;s business objectives, commercial priorities and CRM maturity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead strategic account planning to ensure CRM programmes align with wider business goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the executive point of contact for strategic accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CRM Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise clients on CRM best practice across customer acquisition, onboarding, engagement, retention, loyalty and reactivation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help clients define CRM roadmaps and transformation strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recommend opportunities to improve customer journeys through personalisation, automation, AI and first-party data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate business objectives into measurable CRM programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Success&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own overall client health, satisfaction and long-term success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead Quarterly Business Reviews (QBRs) and Executive Business Reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor adoption, utilisation and business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure clients achieve measurable ROI against agreed success metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify risks and drive mitigation plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial Growth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to expand client relationships through additional products and services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop account growth plans aligned to client priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead commercial conversations around renewals, upsell and cross-sell opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Sales to execute account expansion strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project &amp;amp; Delivery Oversight&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Delivery, Product, Engineering and Solution Consulting teams to ensure successful implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure projects remain aligned with agreed business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Escalate and resolve delivery risks where required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain executive visibility throughout complex programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data &amp;amp; Insights&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use customer data and campaign performance to identify optimisation opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present strategic recommendations based on business insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help clients maximise value product offerings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive a culture of continuous optimisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Communication&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present confidently to executive stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate strategic workshops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence senior decision makers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce clear executive-level recommendations and business cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;PEOPLE &amp;amp; CULTURE AT ZETA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Zeta considers applicants for employment without regard to, and does not discriminate on the basis of an individual’s sex, race, color, religion, age, disability, status as a veteran, or national or ethnic origin; nor does Zeta discriminate on the basis of sexual orientation, gender identity or expression.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We’re committed to building a workplace culture of trust and belonging, so everyone feels invited to bring their whole selves to work. We provide a forum for employees to celebrate, support and advocate for one another. Learn more about our commitment to diversity, equity and inclusion here: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://zetaglobal.com/blog/a-look-into-zetas-ergs/&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;https://zetaglobal.com/blog/a-look-into-zetas-ergs/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;ZETA IN THE NEWS!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://zetaglobal.com/press/?cat=press-releases&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;https://zetaglobal.com/press/?cat=press-releases&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Nebius:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is leading a new era in cloud infrastructure for the global AI economy. We are building a full-stack AI cloud platform that supports developers and enterprises from data and model training through to production deployment, without the cost and complexity of building large in-house AI/ML infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Built by engineers, for engineers. From large-scale GPU orchestration to inference optimization, we own the hard problems across compute, storage, networking and applied AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Listed on Nasdaq (NBIS) and headquartered in Amsterdam, we have a global footprint with R&amp;amp;D hubs across Europe, the UK, North America and Israel. Our team of 1,500+ includes hundreds of engineers with deep expertise across hardware, software and AI R&amp;amp;D.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;The role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we continue to scale our business across EMEA, we are looking for an experienced &lt;strong&gt;Solutions Architecture Senior Manager, EMEA&lt;/strong&gt; to lead our customer-facing Solutions Architecture organization across the region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a leadership role responsible for building, developing and scaling a high-performing Solutions Architecture organization across multiple countries and markets. You will partner closely with EMEA Sales leadership, establish the operating model for the regional team, and ensure our Solutions Architects consistently deliver outstanding technical leadership and business value to customers. The scope of the role reflects where the business is today; as we scale, we expect the organization to specialize and subdivide, and this leader will help shape and staff that evolution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced people leader who can build and empower strong teams while remaining close to customers, technology and our most strategic opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’re welcome to work remotely from &lt;strong&gt;Europe&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;Your responsibilities will include:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, lead and coach a high-performing Solutions Architecture team across multiple countries and markets in EMEA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the Solutions Architecture engagement model for EMEA in close partnership with regional Sales leadership, including how coverage and ownership are divided as the team expands&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish clear priorities, operating mechanisms and performance expectations across the regional Solutions Architecture organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and scale the organization as the business grows, including hiring, coaching and developing senior technical professionals and future leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage directly with CIOs, CTOs, Heads of Infrastructure, Heads of AI/ML, Business leaders and other senior stakeholders across strategic customers and partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion the voice of EMEA customers internally and provide guidance for Nebius&#39;s Product and Technology roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;We expect you to have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven &lt;strong&gt;people-management experience&lt;/strong&gt;, including hiring, coaching and developing senior technical professionals and leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong track record of &lt;strong&gt;leading customer-facing technical teams across EMEA&lt;/strong&gt;, with experience managing teams distributed across multiple countries and markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience building, scaling and operating regional Solutions Architecture, Sales Engineering, Customer Engineering or similar technical organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong &lt;strong&gt;player-coach mentality&lt;/strong&gt; with the ability to operate effectively at both leadership and execution levels — from organizational strategy and talent development to direct engagement in strategic customer opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of the EMEA technology market and the ability to operate effectively across different countries, cultures, customer segments and levels of market maturity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to operate effectively across both the &lt;strong&gt;technical and business dimensions&lt;/strong&gt; of complex customer engagements and influence C-level and senior stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent executive communication, presentation and stakeholder-management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to operate effectively in a fast-growing environment where team structures, coverage boundaries and scope of ownership will continue to evolve&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;It will be an added bonus if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of cloud-native infrastructure, including compute, storage, networking, security and Kubernetes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leadership experience within a &lt;strong&gt;public cloud, hyperscaler or rapidly scaling cloud infrastructure organization&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with &lt;strong&gt;GPU-based infrastructure workloads and accelerated computing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing or supporting &lt;strong&gt;machine learning and AI workloads&lt;/strong&gt;, including training and inference&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of distributed AI/ML infrastructure and the compute, networking and storage considerations associated with large-scale GPU workloads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Kubernetes-based AI/ML platforms, MLOps or AI infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience helping customers evaluate the economics of large-scale compute or GPU workloads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits &amp;amp; Perks:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility and ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative and innovative culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to work on impactful AI projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;International environment and talented teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s it like to work at Nebius:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fast moving&amp;nbsp;- Bold thinking&amp;nbsp;- Constant growth&amp;nbsp;- Meaningful impact&amp;nbsp;- Trust and real ownership&amp;nbsp;- Opportunity to shape the future of AI&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is an equal opportunity employer. We are committed to fostering an inclusive and diverse workplace and to providing equal employment opportunities in all aspects of employment. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy), national origin, ancestry, age, disability, genetic information, marital status, veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applicants must be authorized to work in the country in which they apply and will be required to provide proof of employment eligibility as a condition of hire.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need accommodations during the application process, please let us know.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Media Futures Group:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Media Futures Group (MFG) is a bespoke team within WPP that delivers on our commitment to Google for a more strategic, creative and integrated media approach established to drive better business results.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The MFG team is made up of best in class digital, offline, and integrated media experts who work together to enhance media’s contribution to Google’s business. MFG is powered by WPP Media and other constituent parts of the WPP network around the world. The MFG team operates in a seamlessly integrated way across strategy, planning, investment, creative, production, business sciences and analytics, data and technology. The profile of people who work in MFG are world class, committed to establishing a new high water mark in the media industry.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;MFG is committed to the growth of our people as a means to unleash the potential of Google’s business. We are invested in whole-person wellbeing, values and behaviors that reflect our mission and purpose, and providing the tools and systems needed to do the best work of your career. This is a team empowered by limitless possibilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role / Some of the things we’d like you to do&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is a team leader within the newly formed Global Applied Transformation function on MFG.&amp;nbsp; The Applied Transformation function is responsible for implementing large-scale, global changes as we partner with Google to radically transform marketing in an AI-fueled, data-driven, rapidly changing environment. The Program and Change management team is also responsible for leading projects / programs essential to day-to-day excellence and execution.&amp;nbsp; This role will be responsible for a team of Project / Program managers as well as creating a change management / communications capability.&amp;nbsp; As the program and change management lead, you will wear many hats…&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As leader for the project and program managers team you will…&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide direct line management, mentorship and coaching to project managers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define project management competency models and performance expectations across career stages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide a strategic direction for the project / program management discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish agile / adaptable standards and best practices for project and program management&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As a leader for a cadre of change managers you will…&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish agile / adaptable standards and best practices for change management and communications&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish strong working relationships with Global Functional leads, Global POD leads and Regional leads to understand nuances and unique requirements across operational units that impact adoption and engagement.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own a holistic change management / communications roadmap across transformation workstreams and BAU initiatives to ensure methods and approaches are designed to drive successful engagement and adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;To achieve the above, maintain a “think global, act local” perspective. We should strive for consistency across regions, yet relevance in markets is mission critical.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Where appropriate, partner with the Talent team to leverage tools and expertise to support change journeys&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with key stakeholders and practitioners to proactively identify the impacts and effects of transformation initiatives. As part of this, provide a lens that considers our full organization at all levels and areas of specialism&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Challenge the status quo to ensure transformation initiatives are aligned to strategic priorities / objectives and driving step change&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As a facilitator and collaborator you will…&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong working relationship across the WPP network and MFG team to ensure visibility, clarity, progress and strategic alignment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work across workstreams, projects and programs to solve unexpected issues, facilitating collaboration to stay-on track and removal of barriers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connect the dots as needed across concurrent transformation initiatives to ensure dependencies and interlocks are addressed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with partners in Talent, Operations, and Finance to share context and operate in lock step with our business and people priorities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About yourself / Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project &amp;amp; Program Management / Process Design / Change Management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on, roll-your-sleeves up, can-do leader who’s comfortable setting the vision, getting into the details, and able to connect the dots&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quintessential project and program planner who can plot the course from start to finish, anticipate and plan for risks, seamlessly shift between the strategic and tactical, and course correct as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience operating at a Director level&amp;nbsp; in a consulting / management consulting organization focused on transformation&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SME level analytical and problem solving skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert process documentation, design and optimization skills working in conjunction with functional experts and practitioners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert level change management skills - understands various change management approaches / methodologies, able to create change strategy, identify audiences and personas, create / curate required artifacts, drive and track adoption / impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adept coach and mentor for Project / Program and Change managers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communications and collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable having tough conversations with key stakeholders (internal and external)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written / verbal communication and storytelling skills including ability to tailor messages based on audience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adept at conflict resolution and driving through conflicting priorities across diverse stakeholder groups&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fosters an environment of inclusive collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lifelong learner / innovator / early adopter mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adept at learning new technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive problem identifier and solver&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embraces the opportunity to identify ways to leverage AI, automation and technology solutions to improve processes, drive efficiency and quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develops a deep understanding of Google’s business&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with ambiguity and breaking down complex problems into simple solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2900 – Data Engineer - GCS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media Global Client Solutions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media&#39;s Global client teams are organised within a centralised squad based in London.&amp;nbsp; A critical part of that is the WPP Media Global &#39;Strategy and Capabilities&#39; team - a unit of 160 specialists focused on industry leading Strategic Planning, Insights and Innovation, working across WPP&#39;s global clients including Nestlé, Coca Cola, Danone, Unilever, AirBnB, Ford, Adidas, IKEA, L&#39;Oreal and more. We operate at the forefront of the industry, collaborating seamlessly across WPP&#39;s ecosystem of experts to deliver integrated strategies and drive tangible business outcomes. We believe in the power of media to transform businesses and connect deeply with consumers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is looking for a Data Engineer with interest in machine learning (ML) engineering, as well as the productionisation and optimization of ML models to join our Global Data Strategy &amp;amp; Insights team.&amp;nbsp; While operating within our team you will be asked to use our proprietary and/or client data along with ML techniques to help answer client questions around audiences like: ‘which audience should I be advertising to?’, ‘how should my strategy be different when approaching this audience?’, ‘how is does my media plan need to change across geographies?’. You will also be assisting our team in developing products to help both our global and local teams with day-to-day media planning. This reaches from hypothesis testing, data experiments, and predictive and prescriptive analysis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will have the opportunity to collaborate with other data scientists and engineers (e.g. in our Analytics team) with experience and expertise in a wide range of methodologies, toolkits and applications to a variety of problems in the media landscape. This reaches from data engineering, setting and defining best practices and scaling ML POCs. You will also be collaborating with strategists, insights specialists and non-technical stakeholders to ensure the data structures align with the client use case and specifications.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate would be curious, flexible and passionate about using data science/ML as a tool to understand human behaviour, campaign effectiveness and business dynamics. We are a data agnostic team that believe the key to success is not just having access to different types of data (market research, surveys, online behavioural panels, site data, targeted web-scraping) but finding new, innovative ways to connect and analyse the data we have access to, to deliver real, actionable, insight for our clients.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key responsibilities for this position include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Using data engineering techniques to clean, process and re-format large volumes of data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implementing coding changes to our existing tools to improve them or adapt them for different use cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Testing functionalities of our various tools and providing feedback on improvements that can be implemented.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assisting our Fusion Data Scientist in preparing different types of data for data fusion (incl. mapping variables, recoding data etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performing checks on survey data and preparing data for trend analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain a number of our Python packages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ingesting survey data into different tools to be used for insights, planning, modelling and reporting (both WPP Media and WPP Data Tech Solutions )&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assisting in the development of new products/tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity, flexibility, problem solving skills, a scientific mindset and an enthusiasm for learning new things are key attributes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fundamentally interested in people - Interested in the world around you and what makes people behave the way they do and how data and research can get you closer to understanding it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to work well as part of a team – you understand that one person can’t do or know everything and so you are willing to explore alternative routes, even if they are outside your comfort zone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fast learner, with the ability to work across multiple workstreams at once&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excited by telling stories from information by weaving different sources together into a convincing whole.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to think critically and with curiosity about information sources&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to manage multiple stakeholders&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills we need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills and statistical knowledge, as well as interest in applying them to complex problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competent with Python&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable manipulating and reshaping data to suit a particular task or tale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of Git&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to communicate ideas well, both verbally and written to both technical and non-technical stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of cloud computing (desirable)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of docker (desirable)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to SQL, R, SPSS or other programming languages (desirable)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to&amp;nbsp;Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also&amp;nbsp;Lead Optimistically,&amp;nbsp;firmly believing&amp;nbsp;in and&amp;nbsp;Championing Growth and Development&amp;nbsp;for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to&amp;nbsp;leverage&amp;nbsp;the extensive global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the&amp;nbsp;cutting edge&amp;nbsp;of marketing and advertising.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&amp;nbsp;Create an Open environment&amp;nbsp;built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and has opportunities to progress. This inclusive culture is fostered through a variety of employee resource groups and frequent in-office events&amp;nbsp;showcasing&amp;nbsp;team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our comprehensive benefits package reflects this commitment, including competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We believe the best work happens when&amp;nbsp;we&#39;re&amp;nbsp;together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection in this open and supportive environment.&amp;nbsp;That&#39;s&amp;nbsp;why&amp;nbsp;we’ve&amp;nbsp;adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you&amp;nbsp;require&amp;nbsp;accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&amp;nbsp; Please note that while our philosophy is the same across WPP, benefits may vary by office/country.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy)&lt;/a&gt; for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we appreciate all applications received, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:280}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SharkNinja&amp;nbsp;is a global product design and technology company, with a diversified portfolio of 5-star rated lifestyle solutions that positively&amp;nbsp;impact&amp;nbsp;people’s lives in homes around the world. &lt;strong&gt;Powered by two trusted, global brands, Shark and Ninja&lt;/strong&gt;, the company has a proven&amp;nbsp;track record&amp;nbsp;of bringing disruptive innovation to market and developing one consumer product after another has allowed&amp;nbsp;SharkNinja&amp;nbsp;to enter multiple product categories, driving significant growth and market share gains. Headquartered in Needham, Massachusetts with more than&amp;nbsp;4,100&amp;nbsp;associates, the company’s products are sold at key retailers, online and offline, and through distributors around the world.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI at SharkNinja &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SharkNinja, we’re building an AI-native culture. We’re not waiting for the future; we’re creating it. Our people are expected to experiment boldly, adopt new tools, and continuously raise what’s possible to create meaningful impact for our consumers. If you believe the best way to do your job hasn’t been invented yet, you’ll fit right in.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SharkNinja is looking for an enthusiastic Mechanical Systems Engineer to join the Systems Engineering group within Shark &amp;amp; Ninja Engineering. You&#39;ll identify key system-level requirements, prototype and test to fill gaps where requirements are unclear, align with cross-functional teams, and iterate as projects evolve through development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here are some of the EXCITING things you&#39;ll get to do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive product definition by communicating system functions and requirements across disciplines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build proof-of-concept prototypes with microcontrollers and 3D-printed designs to shape early product direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide engineering, electrical, and marketing teams on tradeoffs within complex thermal and electromechanical products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop unique product design solutions for Shark &amp;amp; Ninja products sold globally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define, design, build, and test new products across the full lifecycle within a multi-disciplinary team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work hands-on in the lab to evaluate, test, and fix design prototypes and production systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interpret test results and feed findings back into product improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ATTRIBUTES &amp;amp; SKILLS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BS or MS in Mechanical Engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in electro-mechanical systems engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience programming microcontrollers — reading sensor data and controlling actuators (motors, LEDs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3D CAD modeling experience (CREO or SolidWorks preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with 3D printing and production processes such as injection molding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong grasp of mechanical engineering fundamentals and DFM manufacturing techniques&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Preferred:&lt;/em&gt; Experience designing/testing consumer products, electromechanical devices, or small appliances; strong analytical skills and ownership of problem resolution; hands-on machine shop/fabrication skills; electronics (analog/digital) and test equipment knowledge; comfort working fast-paced and switching gears; passion for great products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our Culture&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
