&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Excellent time management and communication abilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;8+ years of field sales experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language Skills:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;German and English proficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join Everpure Germany and be part of a team that&#39;s redefining data storage. Apply now and unleash your potential!&lt;/p&gt;
